5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I want to understand the financial reality before we move anything. Who else is concerned about the budget?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,I mostly care about how the desks feel. Does anyone else think comfort is important for the new layout?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Comfort is nice, but my calendar is a minefield. I need to know exactly how much time this reorganization will steal from my day.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let’s stop pretending this is just about desks. We’re deciding who gets the worst spot. Who’s actually willing to take that hit?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m worried about who sits next to whom. It changes how much we actually talk. Can we look at that?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shunichi, that’s a blunt way to put it, but I agree. We need to know the true cost before assigning anyone to a ""bad"" spot.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, I don’t think anyone wants the worst spot. I just want a place where my back doesn’t hurt by four o’clock.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, back pain is real, but my time is money. I’m checking the morning routine upstairs to see how much delay we’ll face.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, checking upstairs won’t fix our floor’s noise. I’m looking at the sound meter readings to see who’s actually suffering.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I’m looking at the staff survey and the plan. I want to see if the layout matches what people actually need.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, the survey shows preferences, not costs. I need the floor billing basis to see if this reorganization is even financially viable for us.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I understand the money matters. I’m looking at the physio’s note and the sound readings to find a quiet, comfortable spot.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
