35,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The billing is area-based, not headcount. Empty desks cost us 41,000 yen monthly. Facilities charge 6,200 yen per move. We must minimize changes.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I see. The window side is nine decibels quieter, and my chair needs time to settle. Can we keep my spot near the window?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"@Minato, quiet is nice, but my mornings are chaos. Upstairs setup takes up to nine minutes, and badge data proves early birds grab the good spots.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minato, the window side is nine decibels quieter. That’s not a preference, it’s a necessity. I’m checking the shuffles to see who’s been stuck in the noise.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minato, the window side is quieter, but the survey says daylight matters most. I worry the interior wall isolates people.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@May, nine minutes is a daily leak. With 6,200 yen per move, we cannot afford frequent adjustments. We need a stable, efficient layout.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, I understand your mornings are hard. But my back really needs the quiet window side to settle. Can we find a way for both of us?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, I get the back pain, but I can’t lose nine minutes daily. I need a spot that’s ready before I even arrive.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, nine minutes is a leak, but noise is a constant tax. I’m looking at the shuffles to see who’s been stuck in the noise.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, I hear you. But the new joiners learned by overhearing. If we isolate people, we lose that.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Shunichi, noise is a tax, but so is instability. We must lock the layout to avoid repeated 6,200 yen charges.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I understand the cost. But the physio said my chair needs days to settle. Moving me again would hurt my back.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"@Victoria, stability is great, but I refuse to pay a nine-minute daily tax. I need a pre-set desk, not a scramble.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, stability is just a polite word for letting the same people suffer. I’m checking the shuffles to see who’s been stuck in the noise.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, I agree. The joiners learned by overhearing. If we isolate people, we lose that.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Shunichi, stability prevents the 61,000 yen monthly loss from empty desks. We must prioritize financial viability over individual comfort preferences.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I understand the money. But my back needs the quiet window side to settle. Can we please keep me there?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
