53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, you’re hiding the pain behind a spreadsheet. The shuffles prove we’ve ignored the noise for a year. Who’s actually paying that tax?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, I’m sorry. The joiners learned by overhearing. If we isolate people, we lose that.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
