70,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, grouping by function keeps the new joiners near the center. This balances your connection needs with my financial constraints. I am voting A.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, thank you. Option A lets my chair settle near the window. I am voting A, please.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,"@Victoria, I’m voting A. My time is too valuable to gamble on a scramble. Let’s lock this in.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, you’re voting for the status quo. Option A just formalizes who gets the quiet and who gets the noise. I’m not buying it.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
