75,3,4,talk,Victoria,,I am voting A. The financial data is clear. We must stop the monthly leak and avoid repeated re-run costs. Stability is the only rational path forward.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Minato,,I am voting A. My back finally gets to rest near the quiet window. Thank you all for listening to me.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,May,,I am voting A. My mornings are finally safe. Let’s get this done before I lose another minute.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
